conformance-checkers	tests for HTML validators, not for a user agent
webdriver	the WebDriver protocol of a browser's automation server; pages cannot reach it
web-extensions	browser extensions
old-tests	unmaintained submissions, mostly manual
annotation-model	Web Annotation data model: JSON-LD documents checked by hand, no user agent behaviour
annotation-protocol	Web Annotation protocol: a server's behaviour, not a user agent's
annotation-vocab	Web Annotation vocabulary: JSON-LD documents, no user agent behaviour
fenced-frame	ad auctions embedded in other sites
private-click-measurement	ad click attribution across sites
trust-tokens	cross-site anti-fraud tokens issued to open-web sites
nav-tracking-mitigations	bounce-tracking defences of a browser that visits arbitrary sites
storage-access-api	third-party cookie access for content embedded in other sites
fedcm	federated sign-in through the browser's account chooser
gpc	Global Privacy Control signal a browser sends to sites
client-hints	user agent hints a browser negotiates with sites (navigator.userAgentData is under ua-client-hints)
device-bound-session-credentials	browser-managed session keys for sites
speculation-rules	prefetch and prerender of navigations to other pages of a site
signed-exchange	signed HTTP exchanges for distributing other sites' pages
web-bundle	web bundles for distributing other sites' resources
network-error-logging	reports a browser sends to sites about failed connections
mixed-content	https pages loading http resources: app pages are http://acde.local, never https
upgrade-insecure-requests	https pages upgrading their http resources: app pages are never https
https-upgrades	the browser upgrading typed http URLs to https
hsts	Strict-Transport-Security: a browser remembering https-only sites
appmanifest	web app manifests: acde apps are described by acde.config.jsonc
web-install	installing a site as an app from the browser
installedapp	navigator.getInstalledRelatedApps for sites with store apps
subapps	installing sub-apps of an installed site
managed	managed configuration of enterprise-installed sites
payment-request	payments through the browser's payment sheet
payment-method-basic-card	payment method of the browser's payment sheet
payment-method-id	payment method identifiers of the browser's payment sheet
payment-method-manifest	payment method manifests of the browser's payment sheet
secure-payment-confirmation	payment confirmation through the browser's payment sheet
merchant-validation	merchant validation of the browser's payment sheet
web-based-payment-handler	sites acting as payment apps of the browser's payment sheet
web-monetization	payments from the browser to the sites it visits
mediacapture-handle	tabs telling a capturing tab who they are: there are no tabs
